## TC-CART-001: Cart page loads correctly after login

> **Why this TC?**
> This is the entry point for all cart tests.
> If the page does not load correctly, all remaining
> TC in this module are blocked and cannot be executed.

| Field | Details |
|-------|---------|
| **ID** | TC-CART-001 |
| **Module** | CART |
| **Priority** | 🔴 High |
| **Type** | Positive / Functional / Smoke |
| **Preconditions** | User is logged in as standard_user, on /cart.html |
| **Test Data** | N/A |

**Steps:**
1. Log in as standard_user (see TC-LOGIN-001)
2. Verify that /cart.html page loads
3. Observe the page content

**Expected Result:**
- The /cart.html page loads successfully
- Page header shows "Swag Labs"
- Menu icon is visible in the top left corner
- Shopping cart icon is visible in the top right corner
- Second header shows "Your cart" is visible under menu icon
- Cart products list has "QTY and Description"
- Footer has two buttons "Continue Shopping and Checkout"
